      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 424451125,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Seems to be all sorts of integer sizing and sign oddness with the values read from the packet (guint32), size (gint64) and offset (guint), I'm assuming the use of an out-of-band value of -1 from get_size_length() to signal an error condition doesn't help.",
